From d473cab6f4dd3dc27dd70917f84ede7db59c63aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Mar 2021 17:57:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 059/196] Always require PrecomputedTransactionData in
 GenericTransactionSignatureChecker. (#109)

Basically deletes the constructor which sets txdata to nullptr.

This change is required for BIP341 sighashes, as PrecomputedTransactionData contains m_spent_outputs, which is required for computing parts of the sighash.
---
